Note I changed slopePitch sign: target Euler(-slopePitch...). If front higher (hf>hb), slopePitch positive, -slopePitch negative → nose up. Correct.

Now flight rates and auto-level. Replace control rates block.

Current:
```js
const pitchRate = 1.25 * authority * tailAuth;
const rollRate = 2.35 ...
const yawRate = 0.6...
...
this.quat.multiply(_q1);
this.quat.normalize();
...
```
Increase and add auto-level after wingBias maybe. Need `up` computed later (line 860) after controls. We can compute a local `upNow` before. Let's insert after `this.quat.normalize();`:

```js
const upNow = _v3.set(0,1,0).applyQuaternion(this.quat);
const handsOff = Math.abs(pitch)<0.06 && Math.abs(roll)<0.06;
if (upNow.y < 0.18 || (handsOff && upNow.y < 0.85)) {
  const fwdNow = this.forward;
  const flat = new Quaternion().setFromEuler(new Euler(0, Math.atan2(fwdNow.x, fwdNow.z), 0, 'YXZ'));
  this.quat.slerp(flat, 1 - Math.exp(-(upNow.y < 0.18 ? 2.2 : 0.8) * dt));
}
```
But `this.forward` uses _v1 set... returns clone; fine.

Also coordinated turn: after controls, add yaw based on roll? `this.quat.multiply` with yaw control already. For faster turning, increase yawRate 1.25.

Maybe player expects "быстрее поворачивать" — increase yawRate to 1.35 and rollRate 3.0. Also general yaw from bank: when rolled, most turn comes from lift vector, but our model just rotates; increase.

Edit.

